  data: {
    LLM: 'Improve your hand by swapping with the table; aim for 31 in one suit or three of a kind. Do not show reaction when someone takes a card you needed.\n\nAssume each player gets about three turns before someone closes. Form a plan and a backup (e.g. aim for three nines; if a nine is taken, switch to improving suit total). Watch which cards opponents take and discard to infer their targets.\n\nMisdirect by staring at an unwanted card. If you must leave a high card, choose one that helps an opponent least. When swapping all three, opponents know your point total for the rest of the hand.',
    Player: 'Improve your hand by swapping with the table; aim for 31 in one suit or three of a kind. Do not show reaction when someone takes a card you needed.\n\nAssume each player gets about three turns before someone closes. Form a plan and a backup (e.g. aim for three nines; if a nine is taken, switch to improving suit total). Watch which cards opponents take and discard to infer their targets.\n\nMisdirect by staring at an unwanted card. If you must leave a high card, choose one that helps an opponent least. When swapping all three, opponents know your point total for the rest of the hand.',
